s-life-dining/residential-life-emporia-state/towers-complex","title":"Residential Life Towers Complex - Emporia State University","content":"Emporia State University\n\n# Residential Life Towers Complex\n\n## Towers Complex\n\n### Life in the Towers\n\nThe Towers Complex offers a variety of activities and amenities. A reception center is located in the main Towers lobby and handles sending and receiving mail, lockouts, and assisting with your maintenance concerns. The complex is secured with a card-access system that only allows students living in the building to enter. Parking is located directly outside the front doors of the main Towers lobby and immediately north of Singular and Trusler Halls. [...] When you’re living in Singular, Trusler, North or South Tower, you’ll find comfort and care in your new home away from home. You’ll meet new friends that will last a lifetime, engage in your floor activities and meals, and have the space to work and collaborate on papers and class projects.\n\nRuntime: 2:32\n\n## Towers Comforts\n\n Heating and cooling.\n Sinks in every bedroom.\n Community bathrooms on each floor that Res Life staff clean and maintain.\n Pool table in the main Towers lobby.\n\n Wireless and wired internet available throughout all buildings.\n Free laundry facilities on-site.\n All four buildings connected through sky-walk and lobby.\n Twin XL bed (can be bunked or lofted), desk, chair, and wardrobe for each student.\n\n### Room Options [...] ### Room Options\n\n Double - One bedroom shared by two students.\n Suites - Two bedrooms adjoining an unfurnished living room shared by four or two students.\n\nExplore the Towers Complex and room dimensions\n\nInterested in more information?\n\nview our full-list of services and FAQs\n\nEmporia State Towers Residential Complex and Wooster Lake\n\n> ## Housing rates\n>\n> Explore housing rates for ESU's residence halls by visiting the Housing + Dining Rates web page.\n\nResidence Halls Application\n\nFind the application + information on deadlines\n\n# Mailing Address\n\nResident’s name\n\n1501 Market St.\n\nBuilding code and room number (ex. South Tower, room 202 OR STT 202)\n\nEmporia, KS 66801\n\n#### Building Mailing Codes:\n\nNorth Tower: NT  \nSouth Tower: ST  \nTrusler: TRU  \nSingular: SNG\n\n###### Related Topics","score":0.62687886,"raw_content":null,"id":"61f656-05"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/emporio-towers-charkop-mumbai-andheri-dahisar-npxid-r381701","title":"Emporio Towers Charkop, Kandivali West - 99acres.com","content":"This includes a gymnasium, club house, and easy access to children's play area. It also has a rooftop lounge, an exclusive offering only for Emporio Towers","score":0.6147415,"raw_content":null,"id":"900db2-06"},{"url":"https://emporiotowers.com/emporio-towers","title":"Emporio Towers -","content":"Amenities · Sample Flat Video · Floor Plans · Location · Contact Us · Sangam Emporio Towers Malad West Logo. Main Menu. Overview · Configurations · Amenities","score":0.60358196,"raw_content":null,"id":"c6aada-07"}],"response_time":4.41,"request_id":"100b82a1-b0a7-4ebd-aabd-9140296edbd7"}